\pard\ltrpar\keep\keepn\sb240\sl259\slmult0\cf4\b0\f3 Introduction\par

\pard\ltrpar\li432\ri1008\sl204\slmult0\qj\cf0\f0\fs24 This project represents a practical application for automating the process of sorting products by color in industrial environments. The system is based on a 1200-PLC S7 module with an advanced vision system to automatically identify and sort products. The system provides an effective solution for factories that require accurate and fast sorting of products\fs28 .\par
\par

\pard\ltrpar\keep\keepn\sb240\sl259\slmult0\cf4\f3\fs32 Objectives\par

\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\ltrpar\fi-360\li720\sl204\slmult0\qj\cf0\f0\fs24 Design of a high-precision automatic sorting system for products by color.\par
{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}Achieve a processing rate of 30 pieces/minute.\par
{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}Provide an easy-to-use control interface.\par
{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}Ensure the reliability and security of the process.\par
{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}Reducing human intervention in the sorting process\fs32\par

\pard\ltrpar\li1238\ri1008\sl276\slmult1\qj\b\par

